# MamaTrack GPS — Supabase configuration
#
# Both values below are REQUIRED for cross-device sync. While they are empty the
# app runs in local-only mode: an SOS raised on a phone stays in that phone's
# localStorage and never reaches the admin, driver or doctor on another device.
#
# Find these in your Supabase project: Settings -> API
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL       = "Project URL"      (e.g. https://abcdefgh.supabase.co)
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY  = "anon public" key  (safe for browsers; guarded by RLS)
#
# After filling these in, run the SQL in SUPABASE_SETUP.md against your project
# so the tables exist and Realtime is switched on.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=""
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=""
